{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A ready-made full-screen “stories” UI for an expanded push notification."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PushwooshNotificationUI provides "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — a drop-in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"UNNotificationContentExtension","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view controller that renders an Instagram-style","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stories experience: full-bleed images, top progress bars, auto-advance, tap-zone"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"navigation, per-frame title\/subtitle, and an optional deep-link button."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The module links only UIKit, UserNotifications, and UserNotificationsUI (plus","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"CryptoKit for a stable cache key), so it adds no Pushwoosh Core\/Framework weight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to your memory-constrained extension process.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Usage","type":"heading","text":"Usage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your Notification Content Extension:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import PushwooshNotificationUI","","class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController {}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then set these keys in the extension’s Info.plist:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PW_STORIES"},{"type":"text","text":" (must match "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionUserInteractionEnabled"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"UNNotificationExtensionDefaultContentHidden","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" = ","type":"text"},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionInitialContentSizeRatio"},{"type":"text","text":" = e.g. "},{"code":"1.5","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (keep in sync with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storyAspectRatio","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"NSExtensionPrincipalClass","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" = "},{"code":"$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).NotificationViewController","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (code-only, no storyboard)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Payload","text":"Payload"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stories are described by a ","type":"text"},{"code":"pw_stories","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block, alongside an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matching "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UNNotificationExtensionCategory"},{"text":". The parser accepts the block either at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"payload root","type":"text"}]},{"text":" (e.g. via the Pushwoosh API ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"type":"text","text":") or inside the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"custom-data container "},{"code":"u","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"userdata","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (the Pushwoosh API "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"data"},{"text":" field — delivered as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a dictionary or a JSON-encoded string). The root form on the device looks like this:"}]},{"code":["{","  \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\" },","  \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\", \"duration\": 5.0,","      \"link\": \"myapp:\/\/sale\", \"button_title\": \"Buy\",","      \"title\": \"Summer Sale\", \"subtitle\": \"Up to 70% off\" },","    { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/2.jpg\" }","  ]}","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sent through the ","type":"text"},{"code":"data","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" API field instead (recommended, since it does not depend on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params"},{"type":"text","text":"), the same block arrives nested under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"text":" — while ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aps.category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(and "},{"code":"mutable-content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the pre-cache path) still go through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ios_root_params.aps"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as there is no dedicated request field for them. The relevant createMessage fields:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"ios_root_params\": { \"aps\": { \"category\": \"PW_STORIES\", \"mutable-content\": 1 } },","  \"data\": { \"pw_stories\": { \"pages\": [ { \"image\": \"https:\/\/...\/1.jpg\" } ] } }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The parser tries the root first, then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"u"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userdata"},{"type":"text","text":", so both delivery styles work"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and old pushes keep rendering."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every field except "},{"code":"image","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is optional. "},{"code":"link","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"image"},{"type":"text","text":") must include a URL"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"scheme. A missing, empty, or malformed payload falls back to the default content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(the alert body) without crashing — override ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/showDefaultContent(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Analytics","anchor":"Analytics","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/storiesDelegate","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to observe lifecycle and"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"engagement and forward it to your analytics (the module itself sends nothing):"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class NotificationViewController: PushwooshStoriesViewController, PushwooshStoriesDelegate {","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","        storiesDelegate = self","    }","    func storiesViewController(_ c: PushwooshStoriesViewController, didTapActionFor page: StoryPage, at index: Int) {","        \/\/ forward the per-page click to your backend","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Instant \/ offline first frame (App Group pre-cache)","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Instant--offline-first-frame-App-Group-pre-cache"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To make the first frame appear instantly (and offline), pre-download the media in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a Notification "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Service"}]},{"text":" Extension into a shared App Group container that the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Content Extension reads from:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Groups"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" capability (same id) on both the Service and Content"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"extensions, and override "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesViewController\/appGroupIdentifier"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From the Service Extension’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)"},{"type":"text","text":", call"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshNotificationUI\/documentation\/PushwooshNotificationUI\/PushwooshStoriesMediaPrefetcher\/prefetch(userInfo:appGroupIdentifier:completion:)","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Send the push with "},{"code":"mutable-content: 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" so the Service Extension runs.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without this, the module still works — images download on display instead.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"Pus